title: BathroomDoorKick
position: 567,-63
---
<<if $potence == true>>
    {$storyteller}: [nomarkup][The door completely flies off its hinges, splintering into the bathroom floor. You underestimate your strength, it seems. Still coming out of your security deposit.][/nomarkup] #lastline #success
    <<CompleteObjective "Q_0P_MAIN_SATURDAY_START" "ENTER_BATHROOM">>
    <<if $kevinmurdered == true>>
        {$storyteller}: [nomarkup][Not that it matters now.][/nomarkup]
        <<set $bathroomdoordestroyed to true>>
        -> [nomarkup][Go inside.][/nomarkup]
    <<else>>
        -> [nomarkup][Go inside.][/nomarkup]
    <<endif>>
<<else>>
    <<if Roll("Strength","Brawl") >= (6 - $strangeInsightModifier)>>
        <<CompleteObjective "Q_0P_MAIN_SATURDAY_START" "ENTER_BATHROOM">>
